  "description": "While Eden is more than hostile to almost all humans, he is singularly partial to animals, often going out of his way to help strays in need. One drunk night out, Eden brings home a battered dog he finds in the trash heap - a dog who, to Eden's shock, turns out to be a giant fluffball of a human. Having no recollection of who he is or where he came from, the handsome stranger begs Eden to let him stay, marking the beginning of an unlikely new relationship between two housemates who couldn't be more different. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
